    "question": "How would you reason about Kotlin Coroutines and Jetpack Compose in an Android application?",
    "slug": "android-developer-how-would-you-reason-about-kotlin-coroutines-and-jetpack-compose-in-an-android-application-8",
    "shortDescription": "Reported Android interview question for mid-level candidates.",
